WEBVTT

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:35.031
va sizning vazifangiz gigantning yoshini
tort markazida shokolad bilan tasvirlash

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:37.658
Siz tort ustidagi shamlarni
sanashni yoqtirasiz,

00:00:37.658 --> 00:00:40.161
ammo siz bu uchun
juda kichkinalik qilasiz

00:00:40.286 --> 00:00:43.664
Keyin eslaysiz: novvoy
tortning ichidan o’tadigan tunel yaratgan

00:00:43.664 --> 00:00:46.125
va u yerdan shamlarni yoqadi.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.212
Gigant uxlab yotganda,
siz yashirincha kirib,

00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:52.090
bildirmasdan shamlarni sanab chiqishingiz
mumkin.

00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:57.386
Kech tushishi bilan kiymingizni kiyasiz,
vanilli kremga sho’ng’iysiz.

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.849
Tunnelning istalgan joyida, siz ustingizda
sham yoqilganligini ko’rishingiz mumkin,